OL,3,AJagtar Singh Johal freed on bail after
OL,4,Anine years in Indian prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohal was granted bail at Delhi High
OL,7,FCourt on 18 September, but has only now
OL,8,Fbeen released from detention.
